stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Killed: app di-install

    Killed --> Resumed: cold launch
    Resumed --> Paused: window background
    Paused --> Resumed: resume dari background
    Resumed --> [*]: os kill
    Paused --> [*]: os kill

    note right of Resumed
      initState()
      cek session Supabase
      WidgetsBindingObserver
    end note

    note right of Paused
      pause stream subscription
      tunda timer
      simpan state ke disk
    end note

    note left of Killed
      dispose()
      tutup koneksi realtime
      flush SharedPreferences
    end note
